  "solution": {
    "text": "Let $S=1!+2 !+3 !+41+\\ldots+11 !$\r\nHere, we see that from $4 !$ to $111,$ we alwars get 12 factor, so it is always divisible by 12\r\nNow. $1 !+2 !+3 !=1+2+6=9$\r\nHence, when $S$ is divided by $12,$ the remainder is 9.",
